OL,3,AWhite House blocks Microsoft from
OL,4,Aforeign worker hiring program
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft and several other technology
OL,7,Ffirms have been barred by the White
OL,8,FHouse from hiring skilled international
OL,9,Fworkers on a permanent basis through a
OL,10,Fwidely used visa program.
OL,12,FVice President JD Vance on Thursday
OL,13,Faccused Microsoft alongside other firms
OL,14,Fof committing fraud through the use of
OL,15,Fthe H1b visa programme and a related
OL,16,Fprocess for workers from abroad to
OL,17,Fbecome permanent US residents.
OL,19,FVance claimed that Microsoft, one of
OL,20,Fthe most valuable in the US, has been
OL,21,Feffectively replacing American workers
OL,22,Fwith "foreign indentured servants."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
